Third-party material

This product bundles third-party material under its own licenses, listed below. The per-file
list (author, source, license) is in ATTRIBUTION.md.

- Inter (assets/fonts/Inter-*.ttf) — SIL Open Font License 1.1. See assets/fonts/OFL-Inter.txt.
- egui default fonts, embedded by the egui dependency as fallbacks — see that crate's licenses.

- vendor/libsqlite3-sys — copy of the libsqlite3-sys crate 0.39.1 (rusqlite project), MIT
  (vendor/libsqlite3-sys/LICENSE), with one change in build.rs marked "MailCraft patch": SQLCipher
  is built with the libtomcrypt provider instead of OpenSSL. vendor/libsqlite3-sys/
  mailcraft-libtomcrypt.h is the LibTomCrypt configuration of sqlite-wasm-rs
  (https://github.com/Spxg/sqlite-wasm-rs, MIT), minus its wasm-only clock override.
- SQLCipher (BSD-3-Clause), SQLite (public domain) and LibTomCrypt (public domain or WTFPL),
  compiled from the sqlcipher-src crate (MIT) into the executable.

